OL,3,APM plans debt reset for Commonwealth
OL,4,Anations as slavery apology talks begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister will join the King
OL,7,Fat the formal opening of the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Heads of Government
OL,9,FMeeting in Antigua later - and begin
OL,10,Ftalks with fellow leaders about the UK
OL,11,Fissuing a formal apology for the slave
OL,12,Ftrade in the next year.
OL,14,FAs part of the discussions, Downing
OL,15,FStreet said Andy Burnham would set out
OL,16,Fhis plans for what it is calling a
OL,17,F"debt reset" to support Commonwealth
OL,18,Fcountries having to deal with the
OL,19,Fgrowing costs of paying interest on
OL,20,Ftheir debts.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
